{'symbol': 'KEYS', 'date': '2023-06-20 11:00:00', 'title': 'KEYSIGHT SUPPORTS VERIFICATION OF OPEN RAN RADIO UNITS POWERED BY QUALCOMM INFRASTRUCTURE SOLUTIONS', 'text': 'SANTA ROSA, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $KEYS #5G--KEYSIGHT TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: KEYS) HAS ACHIEVED QUALCOMM® DEVELOPMENT ACCELERATION RESOURCE TOOLKIT (QDART) VALIDATION FOR THE QUALCOMM® QRU100 5G RAN PLATFORM FROM QUALCOMM TECHNOLOGIES, INC. THIS VALIDATION ENABLES OPEN RAN RADIO UNIT (O-RU) AND GNODEB (GNB) VENDORS TO VERIFY PRODUCTS USING THE QUALCOMM® 5G RAN PLATFORMS THROUGHOUT THE DESIGN AND PRODUCTION WORKFLOW. BY SEPARATING SOFTWARE FROM HARDWARE THROUGH OPEN INTERFACES AND VIRTUALIZATION, OPE.'}